close_reason: "TOON encoding blocks omit empty json_columns and absent, group missing cells by column, and decodePmTableRows accepts that form and every earlier one"
contract_change:
  api: TOON <collection>_encoding blocks and decodePmTableRows
  before: "Every block carried json_columns and an absent list of [row, column] pairs, even when empty, and decoders detected a block by the presence of both arrays"
  after: TOON omits empty json_columns and absent and groups missing fields by column in absent_rows; decodePmTableRows accepts PmRenderedTableCellEncoding and every earlier shape; encodePmTableRows still returns both arrays
  migrate: "Detect a block by its reserved <collection>_encoding key beside the <collection> array, treat a missing json_columns or absent as empty, and read absent_rows as column to row indexes, or decode with the current decodePmTableRows"
